                <UserObject label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;ask the AI block · click to open&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;one ai.stream call (page 1a)&lt;br&gt;streams: each &lt;span style=&quot;color:#db2777&quot;&gt;event&lt;/span&gt; goes to the screen at once&lt;br&gt;abort() mid-stream: stops at once,&lt;br&gt;keeps the partial answer, stop_reason = aborted&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#db2777&quot;&gt;events&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&quot;color:#db2777&quot;&gt;message_update&lt;/span&gt; for every AI &lt;span style=&quot;color:#db2777&quot;&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="data:page/id,ai-flow" tooltip="open page 1a · ai.stream (flowchart)" id="a131">
