                <mxCell id="runnote" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#94a3b8;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#334155;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;what is a Run?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;the server's wrapper around &lt;b&gt;one AgentSession&lt;/b&gt; (one per session)&lt;br&gt;why: the session was built for 1 person, 1 screen (CLI);&lt;br&gt;the web has many users, many tabs, restarts, sandboxes, budgets&lt;br&gt;it fills the sockets (store, env, approve, &lt;span style=&quot;color:#db2777&quot;&gt;events&lt;/span&gt;),&lt;br&gt;keeps the run state, takes commands from the browser&lt;br&gt;in memory only: dropped and rebuilt with no loss&lt;br&gt;(the real data is in SQLite and the session's files)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;→ see Run A1 below&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
